msgid "ArduPilot Rover"
msgstr "ArduPilot Rover"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 441820e0131e422dbd0ec452dcf49b81
msgid ""
"Rover is a sophisticated open-source firmware, specially designed for "
"autopilots in **ground and water vehicles**. This firmware supports not only"
" conventional 3 or 4 wheel configurations, but also extends to boats, "
"sailboats, balance bots, and walking robots. This versatile system is "
"capable of running missions entirely autonomously, which can be defined via "
"mission planning software or manually pre-recorded by the driver."
msgstr ""
"Rover "
"是一款先进的开源固件，专为**地面和水面车辆**的自动驾驶仪而设计。该固件不仅支持传统的三轮或四轮配置，还延伸至船、帆船、平衡机器人和步行机器人。这一多功能系统能够完全自主地执行任务，任务可通过任务规划软件定义，或由驾驶员手动预先录制。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:20 fb80d20841454907a3d7ee8c2654b588
msgid ""
"Rover is compatible with a wide variety of :ref:`supported autopilot boards "
"<common-autopilots>`."
msgstr "Rover 与多种 :ref:`受支持的自动驾驶仪板 <common-autopilots>` 兼容。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:22 ebf010acc4b0445bb7f6dae76137a90d
msgid ""
"Proudly, Rover was the winning platform at the `2013 and 2014 Sparkfun "
"Autonomous Vehicle Competition <https://avc.sparkfun.com/>`__. However, "
"Rover's functionality has extended far past this single event. It's being "
"employed in numerous practical applications, including, but not limited to, "
"agricultural automation. You can explore a few of these applications in our "
":ref:`Video Demos <rover-video-demonstrations>`."
msgstr ""
"Rover 荣获 `2013年和2014年 Sparkfun 自主车辆竞赛 <https://avc.sparkfun.com/>`__ 冠军。但 "
"Rover 的功能已远超单一竞赛的范畴，被广泛应用于众多实际场景，包括但不限于农业自动化。您可在我们的 :ref:`视频演示 <rover-video-"
"demonstrations>` 中了解部分应用案例。"

